In re: Amendments to Carpet One Annexation and Zone Change (Agenda Items #10 & #11)
The attached ordinances are submitted to correct a minor error in the entitlements and legal descriptions
of the applications shown above, specifically, that “Sunny Side” should be shown as “Sunnyside”. They
have been reviewed by the City Attorney’s Office.
The annexation and zone change maps provided by the applicant also have this error and staff is
recommending that correcting these maps be a condition of approval. The applicant has been made
aware of this and has expressed that they have no issues with the condition.
